<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Every day the Lord Himself is near me,</l><l>With a special mercy for each hour;</l><l>All my cares He fain would bear and cheer me,</l><l>He whose name is Counsellor and Pow’r.</l><l>The protection of His child and treasure</l><l>Is a charge that on Himself He laid;</l><l>“As thy days, thy strength shall be in measure,”</l><l>This the pledge to me He made.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Help me then, in every tribulation,</l><l>So to trust Thy promises, O Lord,</l><l>That I lose not faith’s sweet consolation,</l><l>Offered me within Thy holy Word.</l><l>Help me, Lord, when toil and trouble meeting,</l><l>E’er to take, as from a father’s hand,</l><l>One by one, the days, the moments fleeting,</l><l>Till with Christ the Lord I stand.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
